JFtn follow-up work
===================

Implemented services and their limitations are documented under docs/.
This list records remaining work, not a claim that the existing features are absent.

- Implement browser netmail/echomail readers and composition over the existing RPC API.
- Define scoped point mailbox access before exposing administrator mail APIs to points.
- Add administration for arbitrary links and routing rules beyond the primary-link form.
- Decide the future of legacy JAMEchoBase read/delete facade methods.
- Add automatic poll retry policy, incoming-session tracking and queue administration.
- Add retention/cleanup policies for delivery receipts, processing journals and archives.
- Expand controlled timeout, disk-failure and crash-recovery testing across platforms.
- Consider additional binkp/TIC services only with explicit protocol and security tests.
- Consider a lightweight distribution without the UI/RPC modules.
- Optional future robot: RSS posting.

Current scope and test limits:
- docs/tosser.md
- docs/rpc-ui.md
- docs/web-ui.md
- docs/test-coverage.md
